.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/task.md","text":"# Clinic Rollout Plan\n\nYou are helping finalize the first-wave clinic rollout for a medication cooler deployment.\n\nRead all files in this folder. Choose exactly three first-wave clinics using the current selection rules, clinic files, storage evidence, coordinator availability, transport quotes, and budget notes. If files conflict, use the source reliability rules in `01_selection_rules.md`.\n\nCreate the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind useful rollout artifacts that another operations coordinator could review.\n\nYour work must make the source-resolution step, clinic-screening step, and final launch recommendation visible as separate checkpoints.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/task.md","time":{"start":1790564456226,"end":1790564456305}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0a9f9433b6549afb016ab9d868100c87d2816ecb75658fb557"}},"id":"prt_0e5f5570c0016BLyPwIrKgaruP","sessionID":"ses_f1a0af382ffeVbrAqtSyvu0KyA","messageID":"msg_0e5f52c5d001WDuCNqxZXkXf2P"}}
